# Criterion entry tables are stamped data whose layout is part of the tool's
# contract (the stamp sits directly after the entry's `source:` line); never let
# a merge tool rewrite one.
**/entries.yaml merge=ours
**/entries.yaml diff

*.tgz binary

* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
